/* 雷达图组件样式：使用 app.wxss 全局色彩变量，瓷釉卡片质感，布依族蜡染/铜鼓克制美感 */

.radar-container {
  padding: 24rpx;
}

.radar-title {
  font-size: 32rpx;
  font-weight: bold;
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 24rpx;
  color: var(--color-text-primary);
}

.radar-canvas {
  position: relative;
  margin: 0 auto;
  /* 瓷釉微光底，呼应青花瓷釉彩光泽 */
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 48%, rgba(90, 169, 255, 0.06) 0%, rgba(90, 169, 255, 0) 70%);
  border-radius: var(--radius-card-sm);
}

/* 网格线段：transform-origin 左中，旋转至对应角度 */
.radar-grid-line {
  position: absolute;
  height: 2rpx;
  background: var(--color-card-border);
  transform-origin: 0 50%;
  pointer-events: none;
}

/* 轴线：与网格同色，稍重分隔感 */
.radar-axis-line {
  position: absolute;
  height: 2rpx;
  background: var(--color-card-border);
  transform-origin: 0 50%;
  opacity: 0.85;
  pointer-events: none;
}

/* 数据面填充：rgba 品牌色 0.25，clip-path 裁出五边形 */
.radar-data-face {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  top: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  background: rgba(22, 100, 217, 0.25);
  pointer-events: none;
}

/* 数据面描边：1px solid 品牌色（clip-path 不描边框，故由 5 条边线拼接） */
.radar-data-edge {
  position: absolute;
  height: 2rpx;
  background: var(--color-primary);
  transform-origin: 0 50%;
  border-radius: 2rpx;
  pointer-events: none;
}

/* 数据顶点圆点：品牌色填充 + 瓷白描边 */
.radar-data-point {
  position: absolute;
  width: 16rpx;
  height: 16rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--color-primary);
  border: 2rpx solid var(--color-card-bg);
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  box-shadow: 0 0 6rpx rgba(22, 100, 217, 0.35);
  pointer-events: none;
}

/* 顶点标签 */
.radar-label {
  position: absolute;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  line-height: 1.2;
  color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  white-space: nowrap;
  pointer-events: none;
}
.radar-label--left {
  transform: translate(0, -50%);
  padding-left: 8rpx;
}
.radar-label--right {
  transform: translate(-100%, -50%);
  padding-right: 8rpx;
  text-align: right;
}
.radar-label--center {
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
}

/* 全零数据提示 */
.radar-empty {
  position: absolute;
  left: 50%;
  top: 50%;
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  letter-spacing: 2rpx;
}
